'''Deathkory''' (デスコアラッキョ, ''Desu Koarakkyo'', '''Death Koalakkyo''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Kory]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]].

