}}

==Enemy==
Deathkory is an extremely resilient foe with very high damage, 100% chance to produce a level 6 wave attack and a tough shield. His health goes up to 3,670,000 if you don't use any [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercers]]. He however attacks slower than his other variants.

==Strategy==
Deathkory's Waves and Shield are equally threatening. His low range means you can continue to abuse ranged [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shields]], but melee ones will not work at all due to his very high damage. Either way, any should be used to buy your Shield Piercing units more time to destroy his shield, after which he becomes ironically much easier to deal with, as he has more knockbacks than [[Berserkory]].

